(4646065, 669745, 33769, '<td valign="top">I did not score this one low- (tho i think you may get hammered in this challenge?-hope not because it can be discouraging)- but I do have some suggestions (mind you i''m no professional but- hope my suggestions help) - the flower would be amazing if it were more in focus *sure you''ve been told that probably a ton of times already by other users-so i''ll offer other more positive suggestions* (the fact that it is currently out of focus takes away from the rest of the images offered beauty, and the beatuiful shapes created by those purples, and whites and  -someone not paying much attention may miss that shape at the bottom which -looks- like a little bird?!? kinda like a dove? its very abstract and pretty nonetheless! :) -   -when i look past that blury brigh blue flower i see a lot of sharp beautiful lines that remind me of ribbon streamers, i think lookijng just below the edge of the flower is a beautiful negative/image (in a positive way) - good luck! :)</td>', 'I did not score this one low- (tho i think you may get hammered in this challenge?-hope not because it can be discouraging)- but I do have some suggestions (mind you i''m no professional but- hope my suggestions help) - the flower would be amazing if it were more in focus *sure you''ve been told that probably a ton of times already by other users-so i''ll offer other more positive suggestions* (the fact that it is currently out of focus takes away from the rest of the images offered beauty, and the beatuiful shapes created by those purples, and whites and  -someone not paying much attention may miss that shape at the bottom which -looks- like a little bird?!? kinda like a dove? its very abstract and pretty nonetheless! :) -   -when i look past that blury brigh blue flower i see a lot of sharp beautiful lines that remind me of ribbon streamers, i think lookijng just below the edge of the flower is a beautiful negative/image (in a positive way) - good luck! :)', '2008-04-17 16:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
