(4647513, 668047, 39850, '<td valign="top">The effect works well with these tulips(?), still retained a bit of detail around the edge of the petals.  Perhaps cropping out the upper left ''1/4'' one would have made this a stronger image.</td>', 'The effect works well with these tulips(?), still retained a bit of detail around the edge of the petals.  Perhaps cropping out the upper left ''1/4'' one would have made this a stronger image.', '2008-04-18 15:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
