(4650553, 668500, 88054, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Just outside of my top ten due to the lack of color in the sky. I''m betting the photograph is fantastic. Easily in my top twenty.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Just outside of my top ten due to the lack of color in the sky. I''m betting the photograph is fantastic. Easily in my top twenty.', '2008-04-21 00:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
