(4654388, 669179, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ok so now this will at least have one comment.  I gave this a 5 during the challenge.  There were so many different elements to look at here.  And none really popped out to grabbed my attention.  I think it''s a cool looking photo but in a challenge, something has to pull the voter into your photo.  Too bad one of the air-flying eels didn''t sneak by.  :D</td>', 'Ok so now this will at least have one comment.  I gave this a 5 during the challenge.  There were so many different elements to look at here.  And none really popped out to grabbed my attention.  I think it''s a cool looking photo but in a challenge, something has to pull the voter into your photo.  Too bad one of the air-flying eels didn''t sneak by.  :D', '2008-04-23 01:29:11.000000', NULL, 0),
