(4654487, 669365, 70514, '<td valign="top">Well... I''m giggling because I absolutely love this as it just brings me closer to my lovely Kansas and the whole history of it all.  This evokes ideas (for me) of what it might look like during a tornado or even during the times of the dust bowl.  Quite ominious and foreboding.  Defiant, even.</td>', 'Well... I''m giggling because I absolutely love this as it just brings me closer to my lovely Kansas and the whole history of it all.  This evokes ideas (for me) of what it might look like during a tornado or even during the times of the dust bowl.  Quite ominious and foreboding.  Defiant, even.', '2008-04-23 01:55:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4654500, 670046, 70514, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL... and sadly, underrated.  Stunning.... and this transcends the challenge.</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL... and sadly, underrated.  Stunning.... and this transcends the challenge.', '2008-04-23 01:59:45.000000', NULL, 0),
