(4655185, 669973, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hi Dave.  I''m not a big fan of car photos but what I liked about this was that it looked like the lines of the car had been stretched from that one corner and into the background.  Very cool high-keyish look here.</td>', 'Hi Dave.  I''m not a big fan of car photos but what I liked about this was that it looked like the lines of the car had been stretched from that one corner and into the background.  Very cool high-keyish look here.', '2008-04-23 11:09:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655192, 669662, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this would finish higher.  I loved seeing all the lines and how you managed to keep them from blending into the background.</td>', 'I thought this would finish higher.  I loved seeing all the lines and how you managed to keep them from blending into the background.', '2008-04-23 11:10:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655199, 668402, 67697, '<td valign="top">I bet this looks really cool in the inverse.  I love seeing all the painted details on the car.  The spider is a nice touch lol.</td>', 'I bet this looks really cool in the inverse.  I love seeing all the painted details on the car.  The spider is a nice touch lol.', '2008-04-23 11:12:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655200, 669189, 91333, '<td valign="top">I sure wish people who give me low scores could leave a comment too.  I can''t learn to improve if i don''t know what i did wrong.</td>', 'I sure wish people who give me low scores could leave a comment too.  I can''t learn to improve if i don''t know what i did wrong.', '2008-04-23 11:12:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655204, 669435, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol you need to go get one of those "no comments in a challenge" ribbons.  Is this the one that started out scoring so low?  Well it is pretty.  My fave part is the blue and how well it pops out of the picture.</td>', 'lol you need to go get one of those "no comments in a challenge" ribbons.  Is this the one that started out scoring so low?  Well it is pretty.  My fave part is the blue and how well it pops out of the picture.', '2008-04-23 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655206, 670055, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  It looks like it was painted into the picture.  I love the little bokeh dots in the background too.</td>', 'Very pretty.  It looks like it was painted into the picture.  I love the little bokeh dots in the background too.', '2008-04-23 11:15:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655210, 667971, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a shame.  This is not a sub-5 image.  The blue highlight is gorgeous.  I love the arching stem too.</td>', 'What a shame.  This is not a sub-5 image.  The blue highlight is gorgeous.  I love the arching stem too.', '2008-04-23 11:17:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655211, 669293, 45790, '<td valign="top">The white (now black) roof is distracting, as is the probable bird dropping on the tombstone. Also the whole shot seems blurred. Nothing is truly sharp. I''d have gone with a smaller aperture and also apply more USM at the end. People like sharpened (even oversharpened) images here.</td>', 'The white (now black) roof is distracting, as is the probable bird dropping on the tombstone. Also the whole shot seems blurred. Nothing is truly sharp. I''d have gone with a smaller aperture and also apply more USM at the end. People like sharpened (even oversharpened) images here.', '2008-04-23 11:17:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655219, 669827, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well not a sub-5 score for sure.  I love how the center of the flower has that glow coming out, like there was a light shining right behind it.  Nice use of diagonals too.</td>', 'Well not a sub-5 score for sure.  I love how the center of the flower has that glow coming out, like there was a light shining right behind it.  Nice use of diagonals too.', '2008-04-23 11:19:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655224, 668294, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol you are funny.  Should have inverted the flag to see what kinds of comments you would have gotten about that!</td>', 'lol you are funny.  Should have inverted the flag to see what kinds of comments you would have gotten about that!', '2008-04-23 11:21:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655243, 667745, 656, '<td valign="top">Hey! you stole my original idea! ;)<br/> <br/>Congrats on the win.</td>', 'Hey! you stole my original idea! ;) Congrats on the win.', '2008-04-23 11:29:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655248, 667793, 26001, '<td valign="top">got your new PB! nice work and very well deserved high placement.</td>', 'got your new PB! nice work and very well deserved high placement.', '2008-04-23 11:35:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655265, 667802, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very strange, but beautiful. Congratulations on the 4th place.</td>', 'Very strange, but beautiful. Congratulations on the 4th place.', '2008-04-23 11:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655272, 669836, 66384, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the crosses in the windows. I''m not a big fan of religious symbols, but there is something about the way these stand out in the stark environment that really make this picture.</td>', 'I particularly like the crosses in the windows. I''m not a big fan of religious symbols, but there is something about the way these stand out in the stark environment that really make this picture.', '2008-04-23 11:48:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655281, 669975, 8367, '<td valign="top">Uploaded original version.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-23 11:03:33.</i></td>', 'Uploaded original version.', '2008-04-23 11:53:36.000000', '2008-04-23 12:03:33.000000', 0),
(4655284, 669093, 14476, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on making it through your first challenge.  It''s easier from here on.  And I''m delighted that you found your first image in San Francisco.  <br/> <br/>I expect that if you had been able to isolate those pigeons a bit from the rather busy background, your score might have been somewhat higher. But still, it''s not bad for your first attempt.</td>', 'Congratulations on making it through your first challenge.  It''s easier from here on.  And I''m delighted that you found your first image in San Francisco.   I expect that if you had been able to isolate those pigeons a bit from the rather busy background, your score might have been somewhat higher. But still, it''s not bad for your first attempt.', '2008-04-23 11:55:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655289, 667856, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors in this.  Good seeing.</td>', 'Lovely colors in this.  Good seeing.', '2008-04-23 11:56:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655312, 670045, 76430, '<td valign="top">Yes, I obviously gave you a 5.  As a Toastmaster I usually try to give a combination of praise and constructive criticism, and my apologies for not having anything positive in my comment.  I do like the strong vertical lines and the absence of other buildings.  I know the yellow is a negative of sky blue, but I would suggest modifying overall coloring to try to find a more pleasing shade or saturation (maybe it''s just me that doesn''t like it).  I do like the progressive tint of the sky.</td>', 'Yes, I obviously gave you a 5.  As a Toastmaster I usually try to give a combination of praise and constructive criticism, and my apologies for not having anything positive in my comment.  I do like the strong vertical lines and the absence of other buildings.  I know the yellow is a negative of sky blue, but I would suggest modifying overall coloring to try to find a more pleasing shade or saturation (maybe it''s just me that doesn''t like it).  I do like the progressive tint of the sky.', '2008-04-23 12:05:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655360, 667745, 52115, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. Well done.<br/> <br/>A bit confusing. How did you do this?<br/>Could you please elaborate as to which ones are real and which photos are are photos? I see 5 images.<br/></td>', 'Congratulations. Well done. A bit confusing. How did you do this?Could you please elaborate as to which ones are real and which photos are are photos? I see 5 images.', '2008-04-23 12:22:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655364, 669791, 73235, '<td valign="top">great finish for a great picture. congratulations. I like the creative idea behind the picture</td>', 'great finish for a great picture. congratulations. I like the creative idea behind the picture', '2008-04-23 12:24:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655369, 669808, 73235, '<td valign="top">I thought it was yours. Mystery of the lipstick is solved.<br/>Congrats for this unique and very creative pictures. I expected it to be much higher.</td>', 'I thought it was yours. Mystery of the lipstick is solved.Congrats for this unique and very creative pictures. I expected it to be much higher.', '2008-04-23 12:28:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655377, 669777, 73235, '<td valign="top">I just admire your vision for lines and curves. It proves to be strong over and over again. Great job.</td>', 'I just admire your vision for lines and curves. It proves to be strong over and over again. Great job.', '2008-04-23 12:30:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655427, 668693, 49109, '<td valign="top">I found this quite nice in its simplicity and voted it equally, but there''s probably not enough going on to tease the voters</td>', 'I found this quite nice in its simplicity and voted it equally, but there''s probably not enough going on to tease the voters', '2008-04-23 12:52:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655429, 667745, 19944, '<td valign="top">great photo as always, Tim.  Obviously a lot of work.<br/> <br/>But I too would like to know how you did it in basic editing.  I would understand a color kid holding B&amp;W photos, but the B&amp;W kid holding color photos has me a bit confused.<br/> <br/>Please, do tell.</td>', 'great photo as always, Tim.  Obviously a lot of work. But I too would like to know how you did it in basic editing.  I would understand a color kid holding B&W photos, but the B&W kid holding color photos has me a bit confused. Please, do tell.', '2008-04-23 12:53:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655495, 669618, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wow, this inversion really has me stunned as to how much the negative version gets out of the original.</td>', 'Wow, this inversion really has me stunned as to how much the negative version gets out of the original.', '2008-04-23 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655509, 669808, 27845, '<td valign="top">Great! Reminds me of the time I travelled with the Eurostar and the security guy asked me what on earth I had in my photography backpack, showing me the mess all my charger cables created on the X-ray screen. Great approach to the challenge, the only room for improvement I see would be a using a ringlight or something similar to get rid of the shadows.</td>', 'Great! Reminds me of the time I travelled with the Eurostar and the security guy asked me what on earth I had in my photography backpack, showing me the mess all my charger cables created on the X-ray screen. Great approach to the challenge, the only room for improvement I see would be a using a ringlight or something similar to get rid of the shadows.', '2008-04-23 13:20:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655543, 668942, 70369, '<td valign="top">Congradulations Owain !!!!! You are really on a roll.. This is awesome.</td>', 'Congradulations Owain !!!!! You are really on a roll.. This is awesome.', '2008-04-23 13:34:10.000000', NULL, 0),
