(4655611, 669990, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I''m sure glad you DID enter it.  It is amazing.  Usually negative images don''t look like you could ever use them for much of anything else but a negative image challenge -- but this one looks like very awesome art!   Congratulations on a very well-deserved ribbon!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  I''m sure glad you DID enter it.  It is amazing.  Usually negative images don''t look like you could ever use them for much of anything else but a negative image challenge -- but this one looks like very awesome art!   Congratulations on a very well-deserved ribbon! ', '2008-04-23 13:59:08.000000', NULL, 0),
