(4655817, 669773, 89774, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave this a 7.  It should have finished higher.  I liked the placement of everything and also the can colors turned out pretty cool. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you very much for the kind words. I do seem to be going southward lately :(<br/> <br/>Oh well, onward and upward (hopefully!)</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: I gave this a 7.  It should have finished higher.  I liked the placement of everything and also the can colors turned out pretty cool.   Thank you very much for the kind words. I do seem to be going southward lately :( Oh well, onward and upward (hopefully!)', '2008-04-23 15:39:47.000000', NULL, 0),
