(4656475, 669405, 78132, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by boyd2000:</b></div><hr/><i> It looks like an optical illusion.  Are these humps or the insides of cups like 2 litre bottle tops?  I guess based on the things holding them they''re humps.  It looks like a carton of something.  I just made a negative of it and I''m still mystified. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am actually surprised how badly it did in this competition. This is a Styrofoam egg carton and even so it looks like the humps are pointing toward the viewer they are actually inward, which I thought was a grand illusion.  I cannot figure out this DP thing....hmmm</td>', 'Originally posted by boyd2000: It looks like an optical illusion.  Are these humps or the insides of cups like 2 litre bottle tops?  I guess based on the things holding them they''re humps.  It looks like a carton of something.  I just made a negative of it and I''m still mystified.   I am actually surprised how badly it did in this competition. This is a Styrofoam egg carton and even so it looks like the humps are pointing toward the viewer they are actually inward, which I thought was a grand illusion.  I cannot figure out this DP thing....hmmm', '2008-04-23 22:36:58.000000', NULL, 0),
