(4916506, 669489, 76335, '<td valign="top">Only one comment -- how unfortunate. This was a strange challenge. I like this -- the low POV, the juxtaposition of the roof with the ominous (negative) clouds. I might have cropped out the bright area in the extreme upper left. Otherwise, a good image and a respectable finish.</td>', 'Only one comment -- how unfortunate. This was a strange challenge. I like this -- the low POV, the juxtaposition of the roof with the ominous (negative) clouds. I might have cropped out the bright area in the extreme upper left. Otherwise, a good image and a respectable finish.', '2008-08-27 21:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4930701, 667802, 61651, '<td valign="top">Woefully behind on my commenting (yours is the oldest shot in my "to do" folder, and gosh, that goes back to April!) - but belated congrats on your strong finish.  The negative effect carries most of the punch of course, but the fact that it is also a well-composed shot makes this one a standout.</td>', 'Woefully behind on my commenting (yours is the oldest shot in my "to do" folder, and gosh, that goes back to April!) - but belated congrats on your strong finish.  The negative effect carries most of the punch of course, but the fact that it is also a well-composed shot makes this one a standout.', '2008-09-03 09:36:57.000000', NULL, 0),
